    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6900" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cartĭlāgo</span></b> ,
			ĭnis, f.
		Sanscr. kart, to spin; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρταλος</span>, cratis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>cartilage</i>, <i>gristle;</i> in animals, <i><span class="en">Cels. 8, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 11,
				37, 87, § 216</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 24, 40, §
			78</span></i>; <i><span class="en">11, 4, 3,
				§ 9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, in plants, <i>a
				substance harder than pulp but softer than woody fibre</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				15, 28, 34, § 116</span></i>; <i><span class="en">16, 36, 64, §
			158</span></i>.</div>
